    "updated_at": "2026-06-23T09:36:28Z",
    "body": "> [@noamr](https://github.com/noamr) should the fix for [#12543](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12543) also address this issue?\n\nNot direcly but it should make it a lot easier to fix as we have a handle to the element in its token state and we can sanitize it there before any side effects. It's a lot cleaner than trying to prevent side effects deep in the stack.",
